niform density -> no gradient). Value-follower confound isolated by (1) an equal-mass A-vs-B design and (2) the 766 weight-zeroing persistence check (LOAD-BEARING C4: interaction margin survives removing all benefit value because density is weight-independent); CEM scoring is ARC-007-strict (value never enters). No training (non-parametric RBF + read); phased training N/A. Prereqs V3-EXQ-766 (SD-024) + V3-EXQ-767/767a (SD-025). A PASS is interaction-instrument readiness routed through /failure-autopsy before it can move ARC-057; it does not itself promote the claim. NOT the ecological Test C (deferred V4).", "recording_schema": "rec/v1", "substrate_hash": "be9a4d7f2cae17d06196ae3b75f7dda0ceab0afcd0b0a3cd841897ac353bc3ce", "machine": "ree-cloud-4", "machine_class": "linux-x86_64-py3.10", "elapsed_seconds": 28.790263966, "config": {"world_dim": 16, "num_centers": 256, "kernel_bandwidth": 1.0, "horizon": 8, "da_signal": 1.0, "da_allocation_scale": 3.0, "da_jitter_radius": 0.12, "da_bandwidth_narrowing": 0.0, "n_enc": 8, "region_sep": 3.0, "visit_jitter": 0.05, "n_trials": 32, "k_candidates": 16, "target_jitter": 0.1, "curiosity_weight": 1.5, "ctrl_curiosity_weight": 3.0, "familiarity_ema_alpha": 0.05, "familiarity_bandwidth": 1.0, "arms": ["both_off", "sd024_on_sd025_off", "sd024_off_sd025_on", "both_on"], "seeds": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, "seeds": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "queue_id": "V3-EXQ-768a"}